5. Demand satisfaction: sum_r(sales[p,l,t,r]) + sub_received[p,l,t] + lost_sales[p,l,t] = demand[p,l,t]

6. Production capacity: Q[p,t] <= production_cap[p][t]

7. Cold storage: sum_p(cold_usage[p] * sum_r(I[p,l,t,r])) <= cold_capacity[l]

8. Substitution: sub_sales[Basic,Premium,l,t] <= available inventory of Basic

**Objective:** Minimize
- sum(cost_purchasing[p] * Q[p,t])
- + sum(cost_inventory[p] * (I[p,l,t,r] - sales[p,l,t,r]) for r >= 2)
- + sum(cost_waste[p] * W[p,l,t])
- + sum(cost_lost_sales[p] * lost_sales[p,l,t])

