2. Aging: I[p,l,t+1,r] = I[p,l,t,r+1] - sales[p,l,t,r+1] for r = 1..SL[p]-1

3. Waste: W[p,l,t] = I[p,l,t,1] - sales[p,l,t,1]

4. Sales availability: sales[p,l,t,r] ≤ I[p,l,t,r]

5. Demand satisfaction: Σ_r sales[p,l,t,r] + lost_sales[p,l,t] - sub_out[p,l,t] + sub_in[p,l,t] = demand[p,l,t]

6. FIFO: Enforce selling oldest first

7. Storage: Σ_p Σ_r cold_usage[p] * I[p,l,t,r] ≤ cold_capacity[l]

8. Production: Q[p,t] ≤ production_cap[p][t]

9. Waste cap: Σ_{p,l,t} W[p,l,t] ≤ 0.02 * Σ_{p,t} demand_curve[p][t]

**Objective:**
Minimize: Σ cost_purchasing[p]*Q[p,t] + Σ cost_inventory[p]*(I[p,l,t,r]-sales[p,l,t,r]) for r≥2 + Σ cost_waste[p]*W[p,l,t] + Σ cost_lost_sales[p]*lost_sales[p,l,t]

